sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app (VirtualTryOnScreen)
  participant C as VirtualTryOnController
  participant S as VirtualTryOnService
  participant P as VirtualTryOnProvider (FASHN)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + photo storage
  U->>W: Virtual Try-On on a look, pick a top
  W->>C: POST /virtual-try-on (photo, wardrobeItemId, consent)
  C->>S: create(userId, input)
  S->>DB: check piece owner, category, images, quota
  S->>DB: store photo copy, insert row PENDING
  S->>P: generateTryOn(person, garment, "tops")
  P-->>S: jobId
  S->>DB: status PROCESSING
  C-->>W: 202 {tryOnId, PROCESSING}
  loop every 2.5 s, then 4 s, then 6 s
    W->>C: GET /virtual-try-on/:id
    C->>S: get(userId, id)
    S->>P: getStatus(jobId)
    P-->>S: PROCESSING or COMPLETED or FAILED
  end
  S->>P: getResult(jobId)
  P-->>S: imageUrl
  S->>DB: copy result to private storage, COMPLETED
  C-->>W: {COMPLETED, resultImageUrl (signed)}
  W-->>U: result + Save result, Try another item, Back to outfit
